<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Friday 95,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Friday 95,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said actual interior Iowa and southern Minnesota hog receipts Friday matched the estimate of 95,000 head. Saturday's actual receipts totaled 11,000 head, below the stimate of 15,000.</p>
<p>Opening trade was not established. Early sales of barrows and gilts were mostly $0.50 per cwt higher than midsession on Friday.</p>
